READING: n=3 PROVED cleanly (covering + mod-3 Legendre character). The same
harmonic identity reduces every n to bounding a resonance/character sum; the
main term (1-2/n)^(n-1) is opus's independence value. n>=4 leaves the multi-
way resonance correction = the same wall as n=14, now explicit as a character sum.
